<article class="neighbor-card neighbor-card--compare" data-subdomain="wage-tax" data-subarea="northwest">
<header class="neighbor-card__head">
<p class="neighbor-card__tags"><span class="neighbor-card__tag">Wage Tax</span><span class="neighbor-card__composite">Composite · Comparison</span></p>
<h2 class="neighbor-card__name">The income-composition gap</h2>
<p class="neighbor-card__area">Two Mt. Airy households · Northwest · Same total income · Different effective rate</p>
</header>
<div class="neighbor-card__compare-grid">
<div class="neighbor-card__compare-side">
<p class="neighbor-card__compare-label">Profile A — Wage-only</p>
<p class="neighbor-card__compare-detail">$120,000 wages</p>
<p class="neighbor-card__compare-detail">Wage tax: $4,488</p>
<p class="neighbor-card__compare-detail">Effective rate: 3.74%</p>
</div>
<div class="neighbor-card__compare-side">
<p class="neighbor-card__compare-label">Profile B — Mixed-income</p>
<p class="neighbor-card__compare-detail">$80,000 wages + $40,000 investment</p>
<p class="neighbor-card__compare-detail">Wage tax: $2,992</p>
<p class="neighbor-card__compare-detail">Effective rate: 2.49%</p>
